# Signed Android APK destination.
#
# Build a release APK in `web/android` with:
#
#   ./gradlew assembleRelease
#
# Then copy the resulting app-release.apk here as otuburu.apk:
#
#   cp android/app/build/outputs/apk/release/app-release.apk \
#      public/download/otuburu.apk
#
# Next.js static export will pick it up at /download/otuburu.apk on deploy.
#
# The APK is intentionally not committed to git — it's a build artifact and
# adds ~30-50 MB per version. Drop the file here as part of each release.
